  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Slice zucchini into thin half-moons. Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine vegetable stock and the boiling water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people). Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-2699f600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms, zucchini and broccoli, tossing, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-33661f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook onion, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the plain flour and cook, stirring, until a thick paste forms, 1-2 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low, then slowly whisk in the milk and stock mixture until smooth.\n• Stir through light cooking cream and simmer, stirring constantly, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-ffabde20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon roughly 1/4 of the veggie filling into a baking dish, then top with some white sauce and a fresh lasagne sheet. Repeat with the remaining filling, sauce and lasagne sheets.\n• Finish layering with a lasagne sheet, then pour over the remaining sauce. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-020d5330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake lasagne until golden, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-45682a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide creamy golden veggie lasagne between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d7d8c86526e41d967ae650/step-22cc5850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
